DESCRIPTION:The Shaelyn Band is a Florida based band capable of shifting f
 rom classic soul blues and funk to rock. They are fronted by Shaelyn (aka 
 Shae) Mulberry\, a singer and poet who can wail like Joyce Kennedy\, charm
  like Aretha Franklin\, and soliloquize like Erykah Badu. With their highl
 y energized live show\, The Shaelyn Band is poised to take on the music in
 dustry. The band formed in 2020\, after drummer and music director\, Tim M
 ulberry met lead guitar player Erik Guess in Jacksonville\, Florida. The l
 ineup quickly began to take shape by adding bass player\, Curtis Harris an
 d background vocalist\, Mark Barner. On September 9th\, 2022\, The Shaelyn
  Band released their self titled album “The Shaelyn Band”…
LOCATION:Madam's Organ Blues Bar\, 2461 18th Street NW\, Washington\, DC 2
 0009
